      "description": "\"Breaking Format\" is the first single from ABUZU's debut album *Con Razón*. Built around rolling percussion, warped grooves, and Caribbean-infused rhythms, the track is a refusal to conform pushing against traditional structures while remaining firmly rooted in dancefloor functionality.\n\nAs an introduction to the world of *Con Razón*, \"Breaking Format\" captures the album's core philosophy: music made with purpose, instinct, and movement. Equal parts club tool and personal statement, it embraces experimentation without losing sight of the groove.",
