      "description": "Campo Grande’s Rxfx returns to Hochi with SDM2 (Som de Maluco 2), a 12-track album that takes the ritmada sound he’s been testing on dancefloors and builds it into a full-length statement.\n\nRxfx links up with a wide cast from Brazil’s new funk wave: Lucas Kid, DJ ALYX, bieL onLine, dudda, Keu, ARTIGO016, JLZ, Malu Silmon, DJ K1TO and Levynn, plus Clementaum and Mc Indiazinha on lead single EU PULO and NOTRN on the already-proven SIRENE FDP 2. Driving triplet patterns and industrial weight, built to hit as hard on full systems as on blown-out speakers.\n\nSDM2 has already landed on editorial playlists across Spotify (Beat Agressivo), Beatport, Apple Music, TIDAL (Electronic: Rising) and Deezer (New Latin).",
